        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Overlapping Windows"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Two slices of one array can partially overlap",
            "`copy` handles that with well-defined memmove behaviour",
            "`append(x, y...)` is safe when x and y share an array",
            "Hand-rolled loops in that shape are NOT safe"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Windows Into Reused Buffers",
